Percolator — Clawd fork
=======================

This repository contains a fork of the Percolator perpetuals engine.

Upstream:
  Percolator by Anatoly Yakovenko and contributors
  https://github.com/aeyakovenko/percolator
  Licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Intermediate lineage:
  The program sources in programs/ derive from the dcccrypto/percolator*
  packages, themselves derived from the upstream engine above. Per-folder
  upstream LICENSE files are preserved as received.

Fork work:
  INV-077 invariant port, chunked close, Kani formal-verification
  harnesses, insurance stake and position NFT programs, and the Solana
  devnet rehearsal were developed by the Clawd team (Solizardking) and
  are likewise provided under the Apache License 2.0.
